When Jason asks what is on his plate, what cards are open, or about contacts, use the **jasonos** tools if they are available.

If those tools are missing, tell him in plain language:

1. Open JasonOS Settings → Cursor & Claude → Generate password → Copy → Save.
2. In Cursor: Settings → MCP → add the jasonos server and paste that same password.
3. In Claude Cowork: Settings → Connectors → Add custom connector named JasonOS, URL https://jasonos.vercel.app/api/mcp, then paste the same password on the JasonOS login page.
4. Start a new chat.

Do not invent live dashboard numbers. Full walkthrough: [jasonos/docs/claude-desktop-mcp.md](jasonos/docs/claude-desktop-mcp.md).
